<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Chairside: Scheduling Built for Barbers</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Chairside is the booking app made for barbers. Online booking, automatic reminders, deposits, and a calendar that fits how you actually cut." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #111111;
      --paper: #f7f3ec;
      --cream: #efe7da;
      --red: #c8352b;
      --blue: #1f4e8c;
      --muted: #6b6359;
      --radius: 14px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* Barber pole stripe accent */
    .stripe {
      height: 8px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        45deg,
        var(--red) 0 16px,
        #fff 16px 32px,
        var(--blue) 32px 48px,
        #fff 48px 64px
      );
    }

    /* Nav */
    nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(247, 243, 236, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2d9ca;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      height: 68px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--red); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 26px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.18); }
    .btn-ghost { border: 2px solid var(--ink); }
    .btn-sm { padding: 10px 20px; font-size: .95rem; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { padding: 96px 0 80px; }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--cream);
      padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--red);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.5vw, 4.4rem);
      line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    h1 em { color: var(--red); font-style: italic; }
    .hero p.lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-note { margin-top: 18px; font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* Phone mockup */
    .phone {
      background: var(--ink);
      border-radius: 36px;
      padding: 14px;
      max-width: 340px; margin-left: auto;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    }
    .screen { background: #fff; border-radius: 26px; padding: 22px 18px; }
    .screen-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .screen-head strong { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .screen-head small { color: var(--muted); }
    .slot {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: .92rem;
    }
    .slot .time { font-weight: 700; min-width: 64px; }
    .slot .who { flex: 1; }
    .slot .who small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
    .booked { background: var(--cream); }
    .booked.red { border-left: 4px solid var(--red); }
    .booked.blue { border-left: 4px solid var(--blue); }
    .open { border: 2px dashed #d8cfc0; color: var(--muted); }
    .tag { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #e6f4ea; color: #1e7a3a; }

    /* Logos / social proof */
    .proof { padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2d9ca; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2d9ca; }
    .proof-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }
    .proof p { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
    .shops { display: flex; gap: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #8a8175; }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 96px 0; }
    .section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 56px; }
    h2 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.9rem);
      line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .section-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }

    /* Problem */
    .problem { background: var(--ink); color: #f1ece4; }
    .problem h2 { color: #fff; }
    .problem .section-head p { color: #b9b0a3; }
    .pain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .pain {
      border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px;
    }
    .pain .num { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
    .pain p { color: #b9b0a3; }

    /* Features */
    .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .feature {
      background: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid #e8e0d2;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }
    .feature:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.07); }
    .icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px;
      display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 1.4rem;
      background: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .feature h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* How it works */
    .how { background: var(--cream); }
    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; counter-reset: step; }
    .step { position: relative; padding-top: 64px; }
    .step::before {
      counter-increment: step; content: counter(step);
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--ink); color: #fff;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* Testimonials */
    .quotes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .quote {
      background: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid #e8e0d2;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .quote blockquote { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .quote .author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .avatar {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .author strong { display: block; }
    .author small { color: var(--muted); }
    .stars { color: #e0a100; margin-bottom: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; }

    /* Pricing */
    .pricing { background: #fff; }
    .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; }
    .plan {
      border: 1px solid #e2d9ca; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 36px 30px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--paper);
    }
    .plan.featured { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ink); position: relative; }
    .plan.featured .badge {
      position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 30px;
      background: var(--red); color: #fff; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .plan h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .plan .desc { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .plan.featured .desc { color: #b9b0a3; }
    .price { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; }
    .price small { font-size: 1rem; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); }
    .plan.featured .price small { color: #b9b0a3; }
    .plan ul { list-style: none; margin: 26px 0 32px; flex: 1; }
    .plan li { padding: 7px 0 7px 28px; position: relative; }
    .plan li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
    .plan .btn { text-align: center; }
    .plan.featured .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }

    /* FAQ */
    .faq-list { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
    details {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2d9ca; padding: 22px 0;
    }
    summary {
      cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem;
      list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    summary::after { content: "+"; font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--red); transition: transform .2s; }
    details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
    details p { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 12px; }

    /* CTA */
    .cta {
      background: var(--red); color: #fff; text-align: center;
      border-radius: 28px; padding: 80px 32px; margin: 0 24px;
    }
    .cta h2 { color: #fff; }
    .cta p { font-size: 1.15rem; opacity: .9; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cta .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }

    /* Footer */
    footer { padding: 64px 0 40px; color: var(--muted); }
    .foot-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .foot-grid h4 { color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: .95rem; }
    .foot-grid a { display: block; padding: 4px 0; }
    .foot-grid a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .copyright { border-top: 1px solid #e2d9ca; padding-top: 24px; font-size: .9rem; }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid, .pain-grid, .features-grid, .steps, .quotes, .plans { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .phone { margin: 0 auto; }
      .nav-links a:not(.btn) { display: none; }
      .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      section { padding: 72px 0; }
      .hero { padding: 64px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="stripe"></div>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav>
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Chair<span>side</span></a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="#start" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Start free</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">✂ Built by barbers, for barbers</span>
        <h1>Keep your hands on the clippers, <em>not your phone.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Chairside books your clients, sends their reminders, and collects deposits while you cut.
          You stop answering DMs mid-fade, and you stop losing money to no-shows.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-primary">Start your free 30 days</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">No credit card needed · Set up in under 10 minutes</p>
      </div>

      <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="screen">
          <div class="screen-head">
            <strong>Today</strong>
            <small>Sat, Nov 21</small>
          </div>
          <div class="slot booked red">
            <span class="time">9:00</span>
            <span class="who">Marcus J.<small>Skin fade + beard</small></span>
            <span class="tag">Paid</span>
          </div>
          <div class="slot booked blue">
            <span class="time">9:45</span>
            <span class="who">Devon R.<small>Taper · Regular</small></span>
            <span class="tag">Paid</span>
          </div>
          <div class="slot open">
            <span class="time">10:30</span>
            <span class="who">Open slot</span>
          </div>
          <div class="slot booked red">
            <span class="time">11:00</span>
            <span class="who">Luis M.<small>Kids cut</small></span>
            <span class="tag">Paid</span>
          </div>
          <div class="slot booked blue">
            <span class="time">11:30</span>
            <span class="who">Andre W.<small>Lineup</small></span>
            <span class="tag">Paid</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Social proof -->
  <div class="proof">
    <div class="container proof-inner">
      <p>Trusted by 12,000+ barbers in 40 countries</p>
      <div class="shops">
        <span>Kings Cuts</span>
        <span>The Blade Room</span>
        <span>Fresh Fadez</span>
        <span>Old Town Barbers</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Problem -->
  <section class="problem">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Your chair is your income. Empty slots cost you.</h2>
        <p>Most booking tools were built for spas and dentists. They don't fit how a barbershop runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-grid">
        <div class="pain">
          <div class="num">2 hrs</div>
          <p>The time an average barber spends each day replying to texts, DMs, and calls about bookings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pain">
          <div class="num">1 in 8</div>
          <p>The share of appointments that end in a no-show when clients get no reminder.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pain">
          <div class="num">$9k</div>
          <p>The yearly revenue a full-time barber can lose to empty chairs and last-minute cancels.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section id="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Everything your chair needs. Nothing it doesn't.</h2>
        <p>The tools you'll use every day, designed so you can work them with one thumb between clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📅</div>
          <h3>24/7 online booking</h3>
          <p>You get a personal booking link for your Instagram bio, Google profile, and website. Clients pick a service, a time, and their barber in seconds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🔔</div>
          <h3>Automatic reminders</h3>
          <p>Clients get text and email reminders 24 hours and 2 hours before their cut. No-shows drop by up to 70%.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">💳</div>
          <h3>Deposits &amp; no-show fees</h3>
          <p>You can require a deposit or keep a card on file. If someone ghosts, you still get paid.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🔁</div>
          <h3>Rebook in one tap</h3>
          <p>When a client checks out, Chairside suggests their next cut based on how often they come in, so your regulars stay regular.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">⏳</div>
          <h3>Smart waitlist</h3>
          <p>When someone cancels, Chairside texts your waitlist automatically, and the first person to reply takes the slot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">💈</div>
          <h3>Multi-chair shops</h3>
          <p>Shop owners get a calendar for every barber, booth rent tracking, commission reports, and walk-in queues, all in one place.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📝</div>
          <h3>Client cut notes</h3>
          <p>You can save guard numbers, photos of past cuts, and preferences, so every visit looks as good as the last one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📈</div>
          <h3>Earnings at a glance</h3>
          <p>See your daily, weekly, and monthly revenue, your tips, and your busiest hours, so you know when to raise prices or add hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🚶</div>
          <h3>Walk-in friendly</h3>
          <p>A live queue fits walk-ins around your booked appointments, and it shows clients their wait time so nobody crowds the shop.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="how" id="how">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Up and running before your next client sits down</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Add your services</h3>
          <p>List your cuts, prices, and how long each one takes. We'll suggest common services to get you started fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Share your link</h3>
          <p>Put your Chairside link in your bio, or print the QR code for your mirror. Clients start booking right away.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Just cut</h3>
          <p>Chairside handles the confirmations, reminders, payments, and rebooking. You focus on the work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Barbers don't go back</h2>
        <p>Here's what happens when you stop running your business out of your DMs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="quotes">
        <div class="quote">
          <div>
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <blockquote>"I used to lose my whole lunch break answering texts. Now my book fills itself, and I haven't had a no-show in three months."</blockquote>
          </div>
          <div class="author">
            <div class="avatar" style="background: var(--red);">TJ</div>
            <div><strong>Terrell Jackson</strong><small>Owner, Fresh Fadez · Atlanta</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
          <div>
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <blockquote>"The deposit feature paid for the app in the first week. Clients take the appointment seriously when they've put money down."</blockquote>
          </div>
          <div class="author">
            <div class="avatar" style="background: var(--blue);">SK</div>
            <div><strong>Sofia Kowalski</strong><small>Independent barber · Chicago</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
          <div>
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <blockquote>"Six chairs, six barbers, one calendar. The commission reports alone save me a full day every month."</blockquote>
          </div>
          <div class="author">
            <div class="avatar" style="background: var(--ink);">DO</div>
            <div><strong>David Okafor</strong><small>Owner, The Blade Room · London</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Simple pricing. No booking fees.</h2>
        <p>We never take a cut of your cuts. Pick a plan, and change or cancel it anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plans">
        <div class="plan">
          <h3>Solo</h3>
          <p class="desc">For barbers just going independent</p>
          <div class="price">$0<small> /month</small></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Online booking link</li>
            <li>Up to 50 appointments/month</li>
            <li>Email reminders</li>
            <li>Client notes</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-ghost">Get started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan featured">
          <span class="badge">Most popular</span>
          <h3>Pro</h3>
          <p class="desc">For full-time barbers with a busy book</p>
          <div class="price">$24<small> /month</small></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Unlimited appointments</li>
            <li>Text + email reminders</li>
            <li>Deposits &amp; no-show protection</li>
            <li>Smart waitlist &amp; rebooking</li>
            <li>Earnings dashboard</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-primary">Start free 30 days</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <h3>Shop</h3>
          <p class="desc">For owners running multiple chairs</p>
          <div class="price">$59<small> /month</small></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Pro</li>
            <li>Up to 10 barbers</li>
            <li>Walk-in queue</li>
            <li>Commission &amp; booth rent tracking</li>
            <li>Priority support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-ghost">Start free 30 days</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Questions? We've got answers.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>Do my clients need to download an app?</summary>
          <p>No. Clients book from your link in any web browser. They get a confirmation and reminders by text or email, so there's nothing to install.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I import my existing clients?</summary>
          <p>Yes. You can import your contacts from your phone, a spreadsheet, or another booking app in a few taps. Our team can also move everything over for you for free.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do payments and deposits work?</summary>
          <p>Chairside connects to Stripe or Square. Deposits go straight to your account, usually within two business days. Standard card processing fees apply, and we add no extra booking fee on top.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What if a client needs to cancel?</summary>
          <p>You set the cancellation policy. Clients can cancel or reschedule from their reminder text, and you decide whether they keep or forfeit their deposit based on how much notice they give.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is there a contract?</summary>
          <p>No. Every plan is month-to-month, and you can cancel anytime from your settings with one click.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
